    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8733" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀνθεσ-τήρια</span></b> , τά,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Feast of Flowers,</i> i.e.
			three days' festival of Dionysus at Athens, in the month
			Anthesterion, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; also in Ionic cities, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				38.32
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Teos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3655
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyzicus</span>). (Deriv. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-θέσσασθαι</span> is dub.; from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθεῖν</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Ister
				28
			</span></i>.)</div>
